{
  "scene": {
    "id": 0,
    "language": "So here, [0]you just, you just, you don't have to move above the teammate or, um, uh, or be at a distance, certain distance from the opponent. All you need to do is just move to the side of the field, either to the left of the field or the right of the field from where you are by about, um, two to three meters or, well, two to four meters actually. And then... You can, uh, [1]you can actually receive the ball as you are moving towards your destination. Um, [2]and you don't have to wait for the defender to press you. Uh, once, once you see that defender is moving towards you, um, then you can just pass to your teammate and you don't have to check where the teammate is running towards the goal. Just, just, um, just check where the defender is moving towards you.",
